# ===== ARC-0025 stage 1 — probes P1–P6 (throwaway; stage 2 removes every PROBE entry) =====
# All entries live in the DEBUG sections and carry the PROBE / ARC0025 tag. The spells reach every player character
# through ARCANA_Probe_ARC0025.txt (AddSpell on SavegameLoaded), so no list or progression changes.
# Anchors: Shout template = Shout_Arcana_Card_Passive_Compassion (mod; RequirementConditions + HasStatus); container =
# Target_Arcana_Card_Spell_Hemoplague (mod; children `using` the parent + SpellContainerID); TickType StartTurn =
# WIND_WHISPERS (mod); pull = Target_ThornWhip `Force(-3, OriginToEntity, Neutral, false, true)` (vanilla Shared);
# light = LIGHT `GameplayLight(7.5,false,0.1)` (vanilla Shared); combat condition = `Combat()` in Boosts (vanilla);
# Skill boost = `Skill(Persuasion, 2)` (vanilla); DownedStatus = UNDYING_HOPE / UNDYING_HOPE_DOWNED (mod).

@loca PROBE_SING_A_NAME Probe: Sing A
@loca PROBE_SING_B_NAME Probe: Sing B
@loca PROBE_SING_DESC ARC-0025 probe P1: apply Hymn A or B (one replaces the other).
@loca PROBE_CONTAINER_NAME Probe: Container
@loca PROBE_CONTAINER_DESC ARC-0025 probe P1: one child per Hymn; the other child must be greyed out.
@loca PROBE_CHILD_A_NAME Probe: Child A
@loca PROBE_CHILD_B_NAME Probe: Child B
@loca PROBE_HYMN_A_NAME Probe Hymn A
@loca PROBE_HYMN_B_NAME Probe Hymn B
@loca PROBE_CAST_NAME Probe: child cast
@loca PROBE_DUSK_NAME Probe Dusk
@loca PROBE_NIGHTFALL_NAME Probe Nightfall
@loca PROBE_GATED_NAME Probe: Gated
@loca PROBE_GATED_DESC ARC-0025 probe P3: castable once until your next turn starts.
@loca PROBE_GATE_NAME Probe Gate
@loca PROBE_PULL_NAME Probe: Pull
@loca PROBE_PULL_DESC ARC-0025 probe P4: pull an ally 9 m toward you.
@loca PROBE_LANTERN_NAME Probe: Lantern
@loca PROBE_LANTERN_DESC ARC-0025 probe P5: you become a 12 m light; Perception +1 out of combat only.
@loca PROBE_LANTERN_STATUS_NAME Probe Lantern
@loca PROBE_UNDYING_NAME Probe: Undying
@loca PROBE_UNDYING_DESC ARC-0025 probe P6: the next time the ally would be Downed, they stay at 1 HP in Probe Nightfall.
@loca PROBE_UNDYING_STATUS_NAME Probe Undying

